WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.166
It's a magical work, but it's also--

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.583
how to describe it?

00:00:05.416 --> 00:00:08.708
Vampire philosophy. It's fascinating.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.208
So now we're not all monsters?

00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:12.916
Oh, I didn't say that.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:15.916
Go on, admit it.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
I admit there seems to be more...

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:20.291
depth to...

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.416
what would you call it?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.291
Vampire culture? Than I thought.

00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:30.666
There are ideas in here
about physical presence in the world,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.416
the importance of soil and landscape

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.916
and... being.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.208
[chuckles] I mean, actual philosophy.
Amazing.

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:41.625
Well, good.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.750
Then I have a philosophical question
for you.

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:49.041
All right.

00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:54.125
It's hard to do diplomacy
when the other person is in a cage.

00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:57.083
I can't disagree.

00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:59.875
[Lenore]
Diplomacy is compromise.

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:02.208
I get something, you get something.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:05.875
Neither of us get everything we want,
but we both leave happy.

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:10.125
-You have my attention.
-But you...

00:01:10.208 --> 00:01:12.416
you don't even get to leave!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.208
You haven't got anything!

00:01:14.291 --> 00:01:19.333
I have all the power,
and you're a pretty man in a box.

00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:21.916
I'm-- I'm pretty?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.958
It just doesn't seem fair.

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:26.708
What's happening?

00:01:26.791 --> 00:01:29.791
I've been awake all day
thinking about it.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.416
You. Down here.

00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:34.416
What's the question, Lenore?

00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:36.375
What do you want?

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:37.833
I want to be let out.

00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:38.916
I know.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.666
That's all I can think of.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.708
It's the only thing I can do for you.

00:01:42.791 --> 00:01:44.750
But you're not just gonna let me out.

00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:47.416
Well... no.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.833
I'm loyal to my sisters.

00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:53.541
To just fling open the door and say,
"Fly, be free, pretty human boy"?

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:56.833
That-- That would be a direct betrayal.

00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:00.458
Come and sit down.

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:17.000
[chuckles] Also, you'd survive
less than a day on your own.

00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:18.333
That's not true.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.291
Well, OK, that's completely true

00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:23.250
and I would die almost immediately.

00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:25.166
[Lenore laughs]

00:02:27.416 --> 00:02:30.708
You only have one advantage
in this whole negotiation.

00:02:30.791 --> 00:02:32.166
I'm not sure it's an advantage.

00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:35.541
I like you.

00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:38.708
Uh, that wasn't what
I was expecting to hear.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.666
Well, what did you think
your advantage was?

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.166
You want me to do my human magic

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.958
to give Carmilla an army of monsters.

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.125
Oh, that.

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:50.958
I was eavesdropping
on Morana and Striga during the day.

00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:53.041
They can buy mercenaries
to fill out the army.

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:56.625
I don't understand. Carmilla's given up?

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:58.708
She gets distracted.

00:02:58.791 --> 00:03:00.875
She calls it the burden of genius.

00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:04.166
We could run out on her this morning
and she wouldn't notice for days.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.416
I'm loyal to my sisters...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.500
but what we're doing is wrong.

00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:13.708
We could just leave, Hector.

00:03:15.041 --> 00:03:16.500
If you want to be with me.

